","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-25T17:56:06Z","updated_at":"2025-07-25T17:56:06Z","body":"cc @clayjohn \n\nI'm wondering if motion vectors need to be shifted proportionally when perspective scale is used.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3119806223/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3129983728","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108945#issuecomment-3129983728","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108945","id":3129983728,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66j8Lw","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-28T21:53:42Z","updated_at":"2025-07-28T21:54:13Z","body":"> I'm wondering if motion vectors need to be shifted proportionally when perspective scale is used.\n\n@Calinou Ya, looks like the position for MVs is calculated before we apply the clip scale. \n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/2d113cc224cb9be07866d003819fcef2226a52ea/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shaders/forward_clustered/scene_forward_clustered.glsl#L516-L518\n\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/2d113cc224cb9be07866d003819fcef2226a52ea/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shaders/forward_clustered/scene_forward_clustered.glsl#L682-L686","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3129983728/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4372768813","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108945#issuecomment-4372768813","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108945","id":4372768813,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBKMoLQ","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-04T16:43:07Z","updated_at":"2026-05-04T16:43:27Z","body":"I can confirm this on 4.7.beta1 (Linux + NVIDIA).\n\n**Testing project using built-in Z Clip Scale `0.5`:** [bs_visualartefact-minimal-zclip.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/27368897/bs_visualartefact-minimal-zclip.zip)\n\nI've tried to move the above `#ifdef Z_CLIP_SCALE_USED` block just above the `#ifdef MOTION_VECTORS` block but it didn't seem to improve the situation.\n\nAlso, note that there will be small jitter in motion vectors due to floating-point precision errors. This is likely not fixable without introducing some epsilon check when computing motion vectors. (Notice how the motion vectors don't jitter as much when I'm closer to the world origin.)\n\nVideo with the above shader change (project is capped at 60 FPS for consistent appearance):\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/71bad64d-eb64-4c57-a439-162410ac4876","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4372768813/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]